rooms_desc ({"You have entered the quiet house of Apollo.  He has no valuables as youcan plainly see, because he is a poor New Wizard.  Although, he hasnever quite forgotten about what it is like to be a player in the harshunforgiving rooms of Holy Mission.  He remembers the good old days ofwhen he was trusted by all and respected.  However, things have changedfor this New Wizard.  He wants so much to simply have some fun again on thisgame he loves so dearly.  If by chance you have made it this far byvisiting my very own small, but quaint house - I wish to congratulateand thank you for remaining very true and dear to me.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
